description         A fast, intuitive terminal text editor
long_description    txt is a fast terminal text editor for making quick, \
                    precise edits without leaving the terminal. It works \
                    without configuration, is keyboard-driven with familiar \
                    shortcuts, and offers a fuzzy file picker, multi-cursor \
                    editing, AST-aware selection, and optional LSP support.

homepage            https://txt.hellman.io/

